 best Vietnamese food in Ottawa.&nbsp;At Kanata Noodle House we offer an extensive menu with a large variety of noodle, rice and soup dishes from popular Vietnamese cuisine including selections in seafood, chicken, beef, and pork, well as vegetarian options. We will gladly recommend authentic Vietnamese meals that you are sure to enjoy.&nbsp;We are delighted to have just launched our online food ordering service where you are able to order either take out or delivery. You can also come to our restaurant and enjoy a relaxed atmosphere, great food and friendly staff to enhance your dining experience whatever the occasion.&nbsp;Located in &nbsp;Kanata , minutes from the 417 Queensway, we and are open daily from 10:00 am to 10:00 pm for your convenience.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Come in and enjoy our authentic Vietnamese cuisine!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n','',200,40,20,'','K2L 2B5','1','1','1',_binary '0','50','N','n','','45.293396','-75.89394500000003',0,'N',_binary 's:2233:\"{\"1\":[{\"jb\":45.2775439566,\"kb\":-75.8353614807},{\"jb\":45.2908296877,\"kb\":-75.8436012268},{\"jb\":45.2998863568,\"kb\":-75.8508110046},{\"jb\":45.3051989295,\"kb\":-75.8549308777},{\"jb\":45.2995241178,\"kb\":-75.8683204651},{\"jb\":45.3107524505,\"kb\":-75.8762168884},{\"jb\":45.3263235525,\"kb\":-75.88514328},{\"jb\":45.3379085723,\"kb\":-75.8916664124},{\"jb\":45.3478022334,\"kb\":-75.9009361267},{\"jb\":45.3527484157,\"kb\":-75.9114074707},{\"jb\":45.3566085502,\"kb\":-75.9167289734},{\"jb\":45.3626394834,\"kb\":-75.9247970581},{\"jb\":45.3656547089,\"kb\":-75.9308052063},{\"jb\":45.3961597484,\"kb\":-75.9800720215},{\"jb\":45.393748882,\"kb\":-75.9872817993},{\"jb\":45.3892885079,\"kb\":-75.9943199158},{\"jb\":45.3854908849,\"kb\":-75.9985256195},{\"jb\":45.348526092,\"kb\":-75.9517478943},{\"jb\":45.3421316879,\"kb\":-75.9440231323},{\"jb\":45.3402011599,\"kb\":-75.9419631958},{\"jb\":45.3357365616,\