b(105, 105, 105);\">Welcome to Lucky Star C</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;\">hinese Food</span><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-size: 16px;\">! You’re in for a treat. Experience our mouth-watering dishes. Our chefs are renowned for their creative combination of spices and sauces. </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	 </p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial;\">Our company is based on the belief that our customers needs are of the utmost importance. Our entire team is committed to meeting those needs. As a result, a high percentage of our business is from repeat customers and referrals.</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	 </p>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-size: 16px;\">We would welcome the opportunity to earn your trust and deliver you the best service in the industry.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-size: 16px;\">We deliver in the <strong>Orleans</strong> and the <strong>Blackburn Hamlet</strong> area.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n	 </div>\r\n','',200,60,25,NULL,'K1C 7E2','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"3.00\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','10','Y','n','','45.4609703','-75.52389570000003',0,'N',_binary 's:1339:\"{\"1\":[{\"Ya\":45.4395979813,\"Za\":-75.5985975266},{\"Ya\":45.4502265212,\"Za\":-75.5994987488},{\"Ya\":45.4548928111,\"Za\":-75.6013441086},{\"Ya\":45.4597694241,\"Za\":-75.6037902832},{\"Ya\"