style Chinese food with no added M.S.G. Authentic Szechuan and Cantonese food.</span></span></p>\r\n<pre style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Welcome to Ho Ho Restaurant. We have been in business since 1978. The menu, apart from being colourful and thoughtfully laid out, does not distinguish itself from any other &quot;dine-in, take-out, we deliver&quot; Chinese restaurant. But the food is fresh, the vegetables offer more than the usual bean sprouts and bok choy, the chicken has real chicken flavour, the beef is tender, the shrimp crunchy, the sauces have life and none of it has MSG.\r\n\r\nAnd the other real joy of this place is the family that runs it... gracious, amusing and good fun.\r\n\r\nGluten free and and tofu options available.</span></span></pre>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n','',200,55,25,NULL,'K2A 0G7','1','1','1',_binary '2','15','N','n','','45.3792905','-75.77336300000002',0,'N',_binary 's:381:\"{\"1\":[{\"d\":45.4138764608,\"e\":-75.730304718},{\"d\":45.3920612142,\"e\":-75.718460083},{\"d\":45.3884446137,\"e\":-75.7256698608},{\"d\":45.3751817652,\"e\":-75.7234382629},{\"d\":45.3607096547,\"e\":-75.7406044006},{\"d\":45.3219785591,\"e\":-75.8320999146},{\"d\":45.3540753666,\"e\":-75.8478927612},{\"d\":45.4132739428,\"e\":-75.7469558716}],\"2\":[],\"3\":[],\"4\":[],\"5\":[],\"6\":[],\"7\":[],\"8\":[],\"9\":[],\"10\":[]}\";<br><br><br>','Chinese','theme_13','rice-bowl.ico','','demo','123456','','','',0,'y','n','n',0,'n',0,_binary 'a:3:{s:3:\"reg\";a:4:{s:4:\"home\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"menu\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"contact\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"about\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"logout\";a:2:{s:13:\"createaccount\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"signin\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"login\";a:2:{s:7:\"account\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"logout\";s:1:\"1\";}}','round',30,'y','n',1,'c','a:3:{i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";}i: