tra cost associated with quality food and service. Our Menu is Tailored with the family budget in mind and yet still provide&nbsp;</b><span style=\"color: rgb(4, 4, 4); font-family: \'Gill Sans\';\">very</span><b style=\"color: rgb(4, 4, 4); font-family: \'Gill Sans\';\">&nbsp;high quality product. Our sauces are all made in house, our French fries are fresh cut never frozen,&nbsp; Our famous breakfast home fries are fresh cut and and seasoned to perfection with our special seasoning. We only use the freshest eggs from free range hens locally grown. our turkey is real and cooked in house. Our pizza cheese is our own blend and shredded in house for the ultimate in freshness. we only use the freshest vegetables for our salads. Our soups are made daily using the freshest vegetables and real broth for that perfect homemade taste.</b></span></p>\r\n','',200,45,45,NULL,'K2S 0P5','1','1','1',_binary '0','20','N','n','','45.28641090000001','-75.90689520000001',0,'N',_binary 's:603:\"{\"1\":[{\"Ya\":45.2785102965,\"Za\":-75.8626556396},{\"Ya\":45.2624427582,\"Za\":-75.8880615234},{\"Ya\":45.2483043961,\"Za\":-75.8878898621},{\"Ya\":45.2353713594,\"Za\":-75.9066009521},{\"Ya\":45.2386351136,\"Za\":-75.9259986877},{\"Ya\":45.2586970392,\"Za\":-75.9495162964},{\"Ya\":45.2764568046,\"Za\":-75.9639358521},{\"Ya\":45.2944525289,\"Za\":-75.936126709},{\"Ya\":45.3036293576,\"Za\":-75.9170722961},{\"Ya\":45.3102695572,\"Za\":-75.9036827087},{\"Ya\":45.3190817117,\"Za\":-75.8892631531},{\"Ya\":45.3204094518,\"Za\":-75.8858299255},{\"Ya\":45.3042330442,\"Za\":-75.8763885498}],\"2\":[],\"3\":[],\"4\":[],\"5\":[],\"6\":[],\"7\":[],\"8\":[],\"9\":[],\"10\":[]}\";<br><br><br>','Pizza','theme_15','pizza.ico','','demo','123456','kalsplace','','',0,'y','n','n',0,'n',0,_binary 'a:3:{s:3:\"reg\";a:3:{s:4:\"home\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"menu\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"contact\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"logout\";a:2:{s:13:\"createaccount\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"signin\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"login\";a:2:{s:7:\"account\";s:1:\"1\";