	 </div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">When you first opened your location on Bank Street in 2006, just up the road from where my family has lived for the last 40 years, I was so excited. Having a pizza delivery location so close to our home, to help feed my teen boys when I was busy as a working mom was awesome. Your pizza is always delicious – perfect crust, garden-fresh toppings, and flavorful sauce.</span></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">Now that my teen boys are adults and have families of their own, they never have our traditional Sunday dinner at my home! They are always at one of your locations enjoying your pizza, subs, and donairs. Every Sunday, game nights, busy weeknights, they are there with you – I’m so jealous that you see them now more than I do!</span></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">But, I have a plan: this Sunday, my boys will be at MY home for dinner again. With your online ordering system, I can serve them your delicious food, in my home even more easily than before. If you can’t beat ‘em, join ‘em!</span></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">Sincerely,</span></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	 </div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">Grandma Clara Marie</span></span></div>\r\n','',200,60,30,'','K4P 1C3','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"2.00\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','10','Y','n','','45.2771717','-75.56831649999998',0,'N',_binary 's:2092:\"{\"1\":[{\"k\":45.3416490621,\"A\":-75.60593605040003},{\"k\":45.3366415762,\"A\":-75.61