 25 Eastern Ontario locations. Our menu also includes many other favourites like our nachos, hamburgers, salads, subs, wings, donairs, lasagna and spaghetti. We make all our food with fresh ingredients of the highest quality ensuring this will be, &quot;A taste you&#39;ve come to enjoy!&quot;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"width:620px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\">\r\n	<img alt=\"Milano home made crust\" src=\"http://blog.menu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/milano-canadian-citizen.jpg\" /></div>\r\n','<p>\r\n	Milano&rsquo;s a &eacute;t&eacute; dans les affaires de faire la nourriture d&eacute;licieuse, principalement pizza, pendant plus de 40 ann&eacute;es. Nous continuons &agrave; fournir les solutions d&eacute;licieuses aux membres affam&eacute;s de notre communaut&eacute;. Avec la vari&eacute;t&eacute; et l&#39;adaptabilit&eacute; nous maintenons que la satisfaction est possible de des n&#39;importe quels de nos plus de 25 endroits dans tout du Ontario. Avec les ingr&eacute;dients frais nous faisons la pizza fra&icirc;che assurant que ce sera &ldquo;un go&ucirc;t &agrave; savourer!&rdquo;.</p>\r\n',200,60,30,NULL,'K1K 4L3','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"2.50\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','15','Y','n','','45.4461819','-75.63093620000001',0,'N',_binary 's:1415:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.4654693089,\"lng\":-75.64790725709997},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.4652887194,\"lng\":-75.63177108759999},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.4651683261,\"lng\":-75.61323165890002},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.4664926386,\"lng\":-75.5961513519},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.4715488184,\"lng\":-75.58241844179997},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.4710071065,\"lng\":-75.56533813480002},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.4600513718,\"lng\":-75.57168960569999},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.4555962335,\"lng\":-75.58095932010002},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.4454203408,\"lng\":-75.58808326719998},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.440301594440925,\"lng\":-75.59138774868586},