avourites like our nachos, hamburgers, salads, subs, wings, donairs, lasagna and spaghetti. We make all our food with fresh ingredients of the highest quality ensuring this will be, \"A taste you\'ve come to enjoy!\"</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	 </p>\r\n<p>\r\n	 </p>\r\n<div style=\"width:620px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\">\r\n	<img alt=\"Milano home made crust\" src=\"http://blog.menu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/milano-canadian-citizen.jpg\" /></div>\r\n','<p>\r\n	Milano’s a été dans les affaires de faire la nourriture délicieuse, principalement pizza, pendant plus de 40 années. Nous continuons à fournir les solutions délicieuses aux membres affamés de notre communauté. Avec la variété et l\'adaptabilité nous maintenons que la satisfaction est possible de des n\'importe quels de nos plus de 25 endroits dans tout du Ontario. Avec les ingrédients frais nous faisons la pizza fraîche assurant que ce sera “un goût à savourer!”.</p>\r\n',200,55,25,'','K1E 3H4','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"2.99\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','15','Y','n','','45.4771557','-75.49815819999998',0,'N',_binary 's:1008:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.4936753026,\"lng\":-75.52362442020001},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.5001728862,\"lng\":-75.50216674799998},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.51587228451044,\"lng\":-75.45667648319568},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.503902641667956,\"lng\":-75.44689178464182},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.482001834240634,\"lng\":-75.44019699100625},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.46815902102771,\"lng\":-75.43384552001407},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.45112167609481,\"lng\":-75.44328689573047},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.44702713007175,\"lng\":-75.45925140378392},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.44022230048144,\"lng\":-75.47830581668438},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.450218493,\"lng\":-75.4841423035},\"10\":{\"lat\":45.4592496736,\"lng\":-75.4884338379},\"11\":{\"lat\":45.455878202,\"lng\":-75.50508499149998},\"12\":{\"lat\":45.4587680472,\"lng\":-75.5102348328},\"13\":{\"lat\":45.45828641