px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\">\r\n	<img alt=\"Milano home made crust\" src=\"http://blog.menu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/milano-canadian-citizen.jpg\" /></div>\r\n','<p>\r\n	Milano&rsquo;s a &eacute;t&eacute; dans les affaires de faire la nourriture d&eacute;licieuse, principalement pizza, pendant plus de 40 ann&eacute;es. Nous continuons &agrave; fournir les solutions d&eacute;licieuses aux membres affam&eacute;s de notre communaut&eacute;. Avec la vari&eacute;t&eacute; et l&#39;adaptabilit&eacute; nous maintenons que la satisfaction est possible de des n&#39;importe quels de nos plus de 25 endroits dans tout du Ontario. Avec les ingr&eacute;dients frais nous faisons la pizza fra&icirc;che assurant que ce sera &ldquo;un go&ucirc;t &agrave; savourer!&rdquo;.</p>\r\n',200,50,25,NULL,'K1S 4X3','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"2.oo\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','15','Y','n','','45.3915082','-75.68999780000001',0,'N',_binary 's:1252:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.40969987584364,\"lng\":-75.694427490191},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.412230568288926,\"lng\":-75.70198059078626},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.414941898710396,\"lng\":-75.7101345062539},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.41660829757427,\"lng\":-75.7155418396078},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.4176325139,\"lng\":-75.72120666500001},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.4128727632,\"lng\":-75.7181167603},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.406033685,\"lng\":-75.713224411},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.4032315323,\"lng\":-75.71146488189999},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.3964816918,\"lng\":-75.7075166702},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.3955982276,\"lng\":-75.70798873900003},\"10\":{\"lat\":45.390896896,\"lng\":-75.70858955379998},\"11\":{\"lat\":45.3827590518,\"lng\":-75.70635795589999},\"12\":{\"lat\":45.3740170993,\"lng\":-75.70884704590003},\"13\":{\"lat\":45.3692536736,\"lng\":-75.70378303530003},\"14\":{\"lat\":45.3676255754,\"lng\":-75.70206642150004},\"15\":{\"lat\":45.3717861777,\"lng\":-75.69356918329999},\"16\":{\"lat\":45.37