250);\">\r\n	<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Gill Sans MT\', sans-serif;\">We aim to provide a solution to overcome the time and effort of cooking a home-made meal and without the additional expense that dining out involves.</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Georgia, \'Times New Roman\', Times, serif; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">\r\n	<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Gill Sans MT\', sans-serif;\">With quality, aromatic and tasty authentic Indian cuisine, Spice Express is a healthy and affordable option for your dining pleasure that you can conveniently take to the comfort of your own home.&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Gill Sans MT\', sans-serif;\"><i><i>Your</i>&nbsp;Ottawa Indian take-out restaurant!&nbsp;</i></span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Georgia, \'Times New Roman\', Times, serif; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">\r\n	<font color=\"#cc0000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Gill Sans MT\', sans-serif;\">Quality, convenience, and delicious!</span></font></p>\r\n','',200,55,25,NULL,'K1J 7R1','1','1','1',_binary '2.5','25','N','n','','45.4306753','-75.6208105',0,'N',_binary 's:357:\"{\"1\":[{\"ob\":45.459408208,\"pb\":-75.6655883789},{\"ob\":45.4659097442,\"pb\":-75.6360626221},{\"ob\":45.4698825362,\"pb\":-75.5770111084},{\"ob\":45.4478480701,\"pb\":-75.5813026428},{\"ob\":45.4241182831,\"pb\":-75.5821609497},{\"ob\":45.4124304069,\"pb\":-75.6025886536},{\"ob\":45.4059227058,\"pb\":-75.6271362305}],\"2\":[],\"3\":[],\"4\":[],\"5\":[],\"6\":[],\"7\":[],\"8\":[],\"9\":[],\"10\":[]}\";<br><br><br>',NULL,'theme_44','india.ico',NULL,'demo','123456','spiceexpress','spicexpress.ca','',0,'y','n','n',0,'n',0,_binary 'a:3:{s:3:\"reg\";a:2:{s:4:\"home\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"menu\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"logout\";a