;i:1;s:0:\"\";}}}}','(613) 843-9559','chilliesindian@gmail.com','<p>\r\n	Chillies Indian Restaurant in Barrhaven offers you healthy and tasty choices in Indian foods for Dine-in, Take-out and Delivery.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	Start your meal with our offering of healthy soups/shorbas of Dall (Lentils) or tomato or chicken, made from fresh ingredients and served with Garlic Naan freshly baked in Tandoor (clay Oven).<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	Our list of appetizers include healthy offering of Oven Baked Samosas of Vegetable or chicken or the traditional deep fried Samosas.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	An alternate to Samosas are our popular Paneer (Indian sweet Cheese) Pakoras served with Sauce.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	Start off you meal with our healthy offering of Sizzlers, Vegetarian or Non Vegetarian, made just for your with freshest ingredients and served piping hot for an exclusive dining experience.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	The main meal offerings of Vegetarians and Non-Vegetarian items are prepared Fresh to the order and served with flavourful Basmati rice or from Naans from Tandoor.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	A final touch to the dining will be a choice of our desserts of Gulab Jamun or Ras Malai or Kulfi with flavourful Masala Tea.<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	For lunches, we offer a sit down menu or pack the food for you to take away.&nbsp; The food choices are reasonably priced and we offer a wide choices of healthy meals to satisfy all palates.</p>\r\n','',200,50,30,NULL,'K2J 4Y6','1','0','1',_binary '3','30','N','n','','45.27395500000001','-75.74704629999997',0,'N',_binary 's:519:\"{\"1\":[{\"nb\":45.2717455716,\"ob\":-75.791759491},{\"nb\":45.280442927,\"ob\":-75.7783699036},{\"nb\":45.2884143317,\"ob\":-75.7581138611},{\"nb\":45.3125632636,\"ob\":-75.6973457336},{\"nb\":45.2972298838,\"ob\":-75.6985473633},{\"nb\":45.2814092175,\"ob\":-75.6995773315},{\"nb\":45.2602678547,\"ob\":-75.7061004639},{\"nb\":45.2499963513,\"ob\":-75.7045555115},{\"nb\":45.2389977414,\"ob\":-75.6909942627},{\"nb