/p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"width:620px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto\">\r\n	<img alt=\"Milano home made crust\" src=\"http://blog.menu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/milano-canadian-citizen.jpg\" /></div>\r\n','<p>\r\n	Milano&rsquo;s a &eacute;t&eacute; dans les affaires de faire la nourriture d&eacute;licieuse, principalement pizza, pendant plus de 40 ann&eacute;es. Nous continuons &agrave; fournir les solutions d&eacute;licieuses aux membres affam&eacute;s de notre communaut&eacute;. Avec la vari&eacute;t&eacute; et l&#39;adaptabilit&eacute; nous maintenons que la satisfaction est possible de des n&#39;importe quels de nos plus de 25 endroits dans tout du Ontario. Avec les ingr&eacute;dients frais nous faisons la pizza fra&icirc;che assurant que ce sera &ldquo;un go&ucirc;t &agrave; savourer!&rdquo;.</p>\r\n',200,50,25,NULL,'K7C 2V1','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:4:\"2.50\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','15','Y','n','','45.1373484','-76.143032',0,'N',_binary 's:1007:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.1655405883,\"lng\":-76.19482040410003},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.1527097819,\"lng\":-76.22177124019998},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.1468572879,\"lng\":-76.21773719789996},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.1342644713,\"lng\":-76.20039939880002},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.1200942271,\"lng\":-76.20039939880002},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.1148249056,\"lng\":-76.19198799129998},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.1031943364,\"lng\":-76.1674404144},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.088410402578035,\"lng\":-76.16005897526662},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.08886488375977,\"lng\":-76.15057468418445},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.088754799669616,\"lng\":-76.1376571655086},\"10\":{\"lat\":45.08887599431167,\"lng\":-76.10692977910118},\"11\":{\"lat\":45.096631915098556,\"lng\":-76.07654571528673},\"12\":{\"lat\":45.1115348679,\"lng\":-76.06624603270001},\"13\":{\"lat\":45.1329737514,\"lng\":-76.06452941890001},\"14\":{\"lat\":45.1592465896,\"lng\":-76.0775756836},\"15\":{\"lat\":45.17