ial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Malone&rsquo;s is the friendly neighborhood restaurant where everyone can feel at home. It is beautifully located at Dow&rsquo;s Lake at the pavillion. The staff is fun and friendly, and the atmosphere lends itself to a good time had by all.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Malone&rsquo;s is a great place to catch all of your favorite sporting events as well, while eating and drinking with your family or friends. There are 5 TVs which are in view from any place in the restaurant.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">If you are interested in hosting a special event please call to make arrangements, your party is guaranteed to be a good time. Malone&rsquo;s also has awesome daily specials and a fun atmospere all week long, making it the place to be on a nightly basis.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Monday to Friday open at 11:00 am. Weekends open at 9:00 am.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Casual dining overlooking the lake, featuring a variety of meals ranging from steaks and seafood, Greek or Italian as well as a large list of appetizers. We truely have something for everyone.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Offering breakfast from 9:00 am to noon on Saturdays and Sundays.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Kid&#39;s menu available.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">Arrangements can be made for groups during the week.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\" />\r\n	<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: -webkit-center; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 252);\">For reservations call (613) 567-2254&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n','',200,45,20,NULL,'K1S 5K7','1','1','1',_binary '3','20','N','n','','45.3963486','-75.70570190000001',0,'N',_binary 's:684:\"{\"1\":[{\"ob\":45.3941105185,\"pb\":-75.6966590881},{\"ob\":45.3939899732,\"pb\":-75.6918525696},{\"ob\":45.395798125,\"pb\":-75.6879901886},{\"ob\":45.397606218