ried and as sultry as the sub continent itself. Several of the meals on our menu are exclusive to our restaurant.\r\n\r\nOpened in 1999, Restaurant Shawarma Station is a casual restaurant, offering Lebanese cuisine and warm hospitality in Ottawa. A new decorated , exposed brick and concrete floors display the original space, while an open kitchen, banquette seating and gentle lighting contribute to an intimate and contemporary feel.\r\n\r\nWe specialize in Lebanese and Mediterranean  menus, allowing the customer to select any dish from the menu for as little as $10 per person.\r\n\r\nOur food is sourced from top quality seasonal ingredients, featuring a high percentage of local and organic products. Our menu changes every six to eight weeks, offering a mix of new and signature dishes. We consider Shawarma Station to be a truly &acirc;&euro;&oelig;Canadian / Lebanese&acirc;&euro; restaurant honoring many different cooking traditions and interpreting them with our unique creative vision.\r\n</span></span></pre>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n','',200,45,10,NULL,'K1V 1A4','1','0','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:\"3\";i:1;s:0:\"\";i:2;s:0:\"\";i:3;s:0:\"\";i:4;s:0:\"\";i:5;s:0:\"\";i:6;s:0:\"\";i:7;s:0:\"\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','20','N','n','','45.3526315','-75.64687090000001',0,'N',_binary 's:737:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.41604547232851,\"lng\":-75.66181182859066},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.41845538739662,\"lng\":-75.63400268554608},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.37650819,\"lng\":-75.60859680179999},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.3702375438,\"lng\":-75.59040069579999},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.3591416204,\"lng\":-75.56293487549999},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.3374259104,\"lng\":-75.56087493899997},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.3198059375,\"lng\":-75.58525085450003},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.306768458,\"lng\":-75.61443328860003},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.2939694968,\"lng\":-75.68756103520002},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.337184578,\"lng\":-75.6916809082},\"10\":{\"lat\":45.3615539628,\"lng\":-75.68618774409998},\"11\":{\"lat\":45.3774728431,\"lng\":-75.696