 plus grand buffet chinois, szechuan et cantonaise en Outaouais.</strong> Au plaisir de vous servir depuis 2012 au rythme de 10.000 repas chaque semaine.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Rejoignez-nous 7 jours par semaine pour un excellent repas sous forme de buffet. Amenez vos amis et coll&egrave;gues. Notre restaurant r&eacute;pondre &agrave; n&#39;importe quelle occasion. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement commander en ligne et nous livrerons!</span></div>\r\n',200,40,30,NULL,'J8T 5R3','1','1','1',_binary '1.25','10','N','n','','45.4787804','-75.70098439999998',0,'N',_binary 's:536:\"{\"1\":[{\"d\":45.4547121877,\"e\":-75.6916809082},{\"d\":45.4583245457,\"e\":-75.7057571411},{\"d\":45.4573612729,\"e\":-75.7165718079},{\"d\":45.464946601,\"e\":-75.7249832153},{\"d\":45.4719290167,\"e\":-75.7260131836},{\"d\":45.4880574971,\"e\":-75.749874115},{\"d\":45.4931117421,\"e\":-75.7624053955},{\"d\":45.4992484299,\"e\":-75.7632637024},{\"d\":45.5016547916,\"e\":-75.7174301147},{\"d\":45.5107980281,\"e\":-75.6444740295},{\"d\":45.4738550481,\"e\":-75.6381225586},{\"d\":45.467956369,\"e\":-75.6582069397}],\"2\":[],\"3\":[],\"4\":[],\"5\":[],\"6\":[],\"7\":[],\"8\":[],\"9\":[],\"10\":[]}\";<br><br><br>','Asian Food,Soups','theme_150','rice-bowl.ico',NULL,'demo','123456','dubarry','order.dubarry.ca','morder.dubarry.ca',0,'n','n','n',0,'n',0,_binary 'a:3:{s:3:\"reg\";a:4:{s:4:\"home\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"menu\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"contact\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"about\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"logout\";a:2:{s:13:\"createaccount\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"signin\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"login\";a:2:{s:7:\"account\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"logout\";s:1:\"1\";}}','round',30,'y','n',0,'c','a:3:{i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\"