 de des n&#39;importe quels de nos plus de 25 endroits dans tout du Ontario. Avec les ingr&eacute;dients frais nous faisons la pizza fra&icirc;che assurant que ce sera &ldquo;un go&ucirc;t &agrave; savourer!&rdquo;.</p>\r\n',200,0,45,NULL,'K0J 1K0','1','0','1',_binary '0','15','Y','n','','45.6257499','-76.87677869999999',0,'N',_binary 's:74:\"{\"1\":null,\"2\":[],\"3\":[],\"4\":[],\"5\":[],\"6\":[],\"7\":[],\"8\":[],\"9\":[],\"10\":[]}\";<br><br><br>','Pizza','theme_446','pizza.ico',NULL,'demo','123456','milanos','cobden.milanopizzeria.ca','mcobden.milanopizzeria.ca',0,'n','n','n',0,'n',0,_binary 'a:3:{s:3:\"reg\";a:3:{s:4:\"home\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"menu\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"contact\";s:1:\"1\";}s:6:\"logout\";a:2:{s:13:\"createaccount\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"signin\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"login\";a:2:{s:7:\"account\";s:1:\"1\";s:6:\"logout\";s:1:\"1\";}}','round',30,'n','n',0,'c','a:3:{i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"acceptStart\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"acceptStop\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"acceptStart\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"acceptStop\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"name\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"start\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"acceptStart\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"stop\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"acceptStop\";s:0:\"\";}}','0','0','0','','https://twitter.com/milanopizza1','','','5000S13110786','893027204030588891267','April 23, 2014',_binary 'a:12:{s:4:\"home\";s:180:\"Milano - A Taste You\'ve Come to Enjoy - Cobden Pizzeria and Restaurant - Browse our menu for Pizza, Wings, Subs, Italian Dishes and much more. Order online for delivery or takeout.\";s:4:\"menu\";s:142:\"Browse Milano\'s menu for Pizza, Subs, Wings, Italian Food, Burgers and many other favourites. Place your order online for delivery or takeout.\";s:7:\"contact\";s:107:\"We are located at 2 Pembroke St, Cobden. Contact us if you have any questions about our menu or your order.\";s:5:\"about\";s:219:\"Milano is a pizzeria restaurant chain serving Ott