ry 'a:2:{s:4:\"date\";a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"05-08-2022\";}s:4:\"hour\";a:2:{s:5:\"start\";a:3:{s:2:\"i1\";a:1:{i:0;s:5:\"12:00\";}s:2:\"i2\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:2:\"i3\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"stop\";a:3:{s:2:\"i1\";a:1:{i:0;s:5:\"21:00\";}s:2:\"i2\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:2:\"i3\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}}}}','(450) 468-9888','miyukisushibar@hotmail.com','<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Since opening in May 2006, Miyuki Sushi Bar stood out with its originality and attention to the freshness of each of our dishes.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Our goal is to offer you an unforgettabe Japanese dining experience, both in the quality of our specialties by Zen atmosphere here.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The chefs will prepare an elegant, light and balanced menu, shaped by the rules of the Japanese culinary art with utmost care&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Come to Miyuki Sushi Barm, where the beauty of the scenery and exquisite design awakens your senses when you embark on an unforgettable culinary journey.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Our clientele consists primarily of business people and residents of South Shore. In addition, several personalities from the arts community come to our restaurant.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">It is also possible to prepare your sushi and hot dishes in advance for you to enjoy in the comfort of your home.</span></div>\r\n','<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Depuis l&rsquo;ouverture en mai 2006, Miyuki Sushi Bar s&rsquo;est d&eacute;marqu&eacute; par son originalit&eacute; et par son attention &agrave; la fra&icirc;cheur de chaque ingr&eacute;dient minutieusement s&eacute;lectionn&eacute; qui compose chacun de nos plats.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Notre but est de vous offrir une exp&eacute;rience gastronomique nipponne inoubliable, tant par la qualit&eacute; de nos sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s que par l&rsquo;ambiance zen qui y r&egrave;gne. Nos chefs vous concocteront un menu raffin&eacute;, l&eacute;ger et &eacute;quilibr&eacute; fa&ccedil;onn&eacute; selon les r&egrave;gles de l&rsquo;art culinaire japonais avec le plus grand soin.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Venez chez Miyuki Sushi Bar, o&ugrave; la beaut&eacute; du d&eacute;cor et le design exquis des lumi&egrave;res &eacute;veilleront vos sens au moment o&ugrave; vous embarquerez pour un voyage culinaire m&eacute;morable.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Notre client&egrave;le est principalement compos&eacute; des gens d&rsquo;affaires et des r&eacute;sidents de la rive-sud. De plus, plusieurs personnalit&eacute;s du milieu artistique fr&eacute;quentent notre restaurant.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 11.8181819915771px; text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Il est &eacute;galement possible de faire pr&eacute;parer votre commande de sushi et de plats chauds d&rsquo;avance afin de les savourer dans le confort du chez-soi.</span></div>\r\n',200,75,60,NULL,'J4N 1P8','1','1','1',_binary 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:\"0\";i:1;s:1:\"1\";i:2;s:1:\"2\";i:3;s:1:\"3\";i:4;s:1:\"4\";i:5;s:1:\"5\";i:6;s:1:\"6\";i:7;s:1:\"7\";i:8;s:0:\"\";i:9;s:0:\"\";}','40','N','n','','45.5657638','-73.4501985',0,'Y',_binary 's:19698:\"{\"1\":{\"0\":{\"lat\":45.567806796277765,\"lng\":-73.41088804467773},\"1\":{\"lat\":45.55843243700061,\"lng\":-73.4120896743164},\"2\":{\"lat\":45.55085969719281,\"lng\":-73.41826948388672},\"3\":{\"lat\":45.54695272607364,\"lng\":-73.42238935693359},\"4\":{\"lat\":45.54319576697209,\"lng\":-73.43153032525635},\"5\":{\"lat\":45.54037036832737,\"lng\":-73.44058546289062},\"6\":{\"lat\":45.540009668918664,\"lng\":-73.4435895369873},\"7\":{\"lat\":45.53973914284357,\"lng\":-73.4490827010498},\"8\":{\"lat\":45.53979925986166,\"lng\":-73.45487627252197},\"9\":{\"lat\":45.54061083331432,\"lng\":-73.45976862176514},\"10\":{\"lat\":45.54208365891863,\"lng\":-73.4650042937622},\"11\":{\"lat\":45.54349633294,\"lng\":-73.46890959008789},\"12\":{\"lat\":45.54620135433983,\"lng\":-73.47444566949463},\"13\":{\"lat\":45.54890624557929,\"lng\":-73.47796472772217},\"14\":{\"lat\":45.55230220249715,\"lng\":-73.48152670129394},\"15\":{\"lat\":45.55626890118317,\"lng\":-73.48440202935791},\"16\":{\"lat\":45.55966441322826,\"lng\":-73.48603281243896},\"17\":{\"lat\":45.56396109452069,\"lng\":-73.48684820397949},\"18\":{\"lat\":45.56648486599421,\"lng\":-73.48723444